    "EcoHorizon Global — Global Multimodal Freight Visibility Platform": "EcoHorizon Global — Platform Visibilitas Kargo Multimoda Global",
    "Your Cargo Journey,": "Perjalanan Kargo Anda,",
    "Clearly Connected.": "Terhubung Nyata.",
    "Track sea, land, and air shipments in one unified platform. Monitor delivery milestones, manage logistics exceptions, and understand estimated transport carbon emissions with transparency.": "Lacak pengiriman laut, darat, dan udara dalam satu platform terpadu. Pantau tahapan pengiriman, kelola kendala logistik, dan pahami estimasi emisi karbon transportasi secara transparan.",
    "Enter shipment tracking number (e.g. EHG-20261029-JKTMUC)": "Masukkan nomor resi pelacakan kargo (contoh: EHG-20261029-JKTMUC)",
    "Track": "Lacak",
    "Evaluation Flagship Journeys:": "Rute Evaluasi Utama:",
    "Multimodal Electronics (Sea-Air-Road)": "Elektronik Multimoda (Laut-Udara-Darat)",
    "Ocean Delay (Shanghai → Rotterdam)": "Keterlambatan Laut (Shanghai → Rotterdam)",
    "B2B Warehouse Delivered (Surabaya)": "Terkirim ke Gudang B2B (Surabaya)",
    "Air Cargo Customs Exception": "Kendala Bea Cukai Kargo Udara",
