    "Connected Across All Dimensions": "Terhubung di Seluruh Dimensi",
    "Multimodal Freight Infrastructure": "Infrastruktur Kargo Multimoda",
    "A single cargo journey often transitions across ports, airports, highways, and rail lines. EcoHorizon maintains end-to-end accountability at every handover.": "Satu perjalanan kargo kerap berpindah antar pelabuhan, bandara, jalan raya, dan rel kereta. EcoHorizon menjaga akuntabilitas ujung-ke-ujung di setiap titik serah terima.",
    "Maritime Sea Freight": "Muatan Kapal Laut",
    "Ultra Large Container Vessels (ULCV) and regional feeder lines. Lowest carbon footprint per tonne-kilometer (~15 g CO₂e/t-km). Monitored with port berthing and terminal discharges.": "Kapal Peti Kemas Sangat Besar (ULCV) dan jalur pengumpan regional. Jejak karbon terendah per ton-kilometer (~15 g CO₂e/t-km). Dipantau dengan sandar pelabuhan dan bongkar terminal.",
    "Average Factor:": "Faktor Rata-rata:",
    "Overland Road & Rail": "Jalur Darat Jalan Raya & Kereta",
    "First-mile pickup and final-mile delivery. Heavy Euro-6 articulated trucks and electric freight trains connecting manufacturing clusters directly to port container terminals.": "Penjemputan awal (first-mile) dan pengantaran akhir (final-mile). Truk gandeng Euro-6 dan kereta kargo listrik yang menghubungkan klaster manufaktur langsung ke terminal peti kemas.",
    "Intercontinental Air Cargo": "Kargo Udara Antarbenua",
    "Dedicated freighters and wide-body belly cargo for high-value electronics and urgent medical equipment. High speed with transparently accounted carbon impact.": "Pesawat kargo khusus dan kompartemen kargo berbadan lebar untuk elektronik bernilai tinggi dan peralatan medis darurat. Kecepatan tinggi dengan jejak karbon yang dihitung secara transparan.",
    "Structured Delivery Conditions": "Kondisi Pengiriman Terstruktur",
    "Delivery Service Levels & Handover Rules": "Tingkat Layanan Pengiriman & Aturan Serah Terima",
    "Arrival at an intermediate terminal does not mean final delivery. EcoHorizon models contractual handover conditions strictly based on agreed Incoterms and service tiers.": "Tiba di terminal perantara tidak berarti pengiriman selesai. EcoHorizon memodelkan kondisi serah terima kontraktual secara ketat berdasarkan Incoterms dan tingkat layanan yang disepakati.",
    "Pickup Required:": "Perlu Penjemputan:",
    "Final Delivery Proof:": "Bukti Pengiriman Akhir:",
    "Yes": "Ya",
    "No": "Tidak",
    "Mandatory": "Wajib",
    "Terminal Release": "Pelepasan Terminal",
    "Unlike platforms that claim unverified \"carbon neutrality\", EcoHorizon implements rigorous multimodal greenhouse gas (GHG) calculations conforming to the Global Logistics Emissions Council (GLEC) Framework v3.0 and IMO MEPC.308 guidelines.": "Berbeda dengan platform yang mengklaim \"netralitas karbon\" tanpa verifikasi, EcoHorizon menerapkan kalkulasi gas rumah kaca (GRK) multimoda yang ketat sesuai dengan Global Logistics Emissions Council (GLEC) Framework v3.0 dan panduan IMO MEPC.308.",
    "Governing Emission Formula:": "Formula Acuan Perhitungan Emisi:",
    "Estimated CO₂e (kg) = Cargo Weight (tonnes) × Distance (km) × Factor (g CO₂e / tonne-km) ÷ 1,000": "Estimasi CO₂e (kg) = Berat Kargo (ton) × Jarak (km) × Faktor (g CO₂e / ton-km) ÷ 1.000",
    "Every transport leg is calculated individually according to its specific mode, vehicle class, and corridor distance before being aggregated into total consignment footprints.": "Setiap kaki rute transportasi dihitung secara individual sesuai dengan moda spesifik, kelas armada, dan jarak koridor sebelum diagregasikan menjadi total jejak konsinyasi.",
